{"ticker":"NTAP","updated":"2026-10-30T23:01:55Z","profile":{"longName":"NetApp, Inc.","shortName":"NetApp, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","country":"United States","website":"https://www.netapp.com","fullTimeEmployees":11700,"marketCap":39122735104,"trailingPE":28.093088,"forwardPE":17.847046,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.293294,"pegRatio":2.42,"targetMeanPrice":211.6875,"targetHighPrice":300.0,"targetLowPrice":170.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.299,"earningsGrowth":0.635,"grossMargins":0.70625997,"operatingMargins":0.26667,"profitMargins":0.19184999,"totalRevenue":7391000064,"beta":1.45,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":240.87,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":93.69,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.95},"summary":"NetApp, Inc. develops enterprise software, systems, and services to transform data infrastructures in the United States, Canada, Latin America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. It operates through two segments, Hybrid Cloud and Public Cloud. The company offers data management software, such as NetApp ONTAP, ONTAP One, NetApp Snapshot, NetApp SnapCenter Backup Management, NetApp SnapMirror Data Replication, and NetApp SnapLock Data Compliance; and storage infrastructure solutions, including NetApp AFF and ASA A-Series and C-Series, NetApp AFX, NetApp Fabric Attached Storage (FAS), NetApp E/EF series, and NetApp StorageGRID. It also provides cloud storage services comprising Azure NetApp Files, Amazon FSx for NetApp ONTAP, and Google Cloud NetApp Volumes, as well as NetApp Cloud Volumes ONTAP. In addition, the company offers operational services, such as NetApp Data Infrastructure Insights and Instaclustr; and professional and support services include storage-as-a-service (STaaS), strategic consulting, professional, managed, and support services, as well as assessment, design, implementation, migration, and proactive support services to optimize the performance and efficiency of their on-premises and hybrid multicloud storage environments. Further, it offers ransomware protection, data backup and recovery, and disaster recovery. It serves various industries ","summary_zh":"NetApp, Inc. 開發企業軟體、系統和服務，以改造美國、加拿大、拉丁美洲、歐洲、中東、非洲和亞太地區的資料基礎設施。它透過兩個部門運作：混合雲端和公有雲。該公司提供資料管理軟體，如 NetApp ONTAP、ONTAP One、NetApp Snapshot、NetApp SnapCenter Backup Management、NetApp SnapMirror Data Replication 和 NetApp SnapLock Data Compliance；和儲存基礎設施解決方案，包括 NetApp AFF 和 ASA A 系列和 C 系列、NetApp AFX、NetS 結構式儲存 (它還提供雲端儲存服務，包括 Azure NetApp Files、Amazon FSx for NetApp ONTAP、Google Cloud NetApp Volumes 以及 NetApp Cloud Volumes ONTAP。此外，該公司還提供營運服務，例如 NetApp Data Infrastructure Insights 和 Instaclustr；專業和支援服務包括儲存即服務 (STaaS)、策略諮詢、專業、託管和支援服務，以及評估、設計、實施、遷移和主動支援服務，以優化本地和混合多雲儲存環境的效能和效率。此外，它還提供勒索軟體防護、資料備份和復原以及災難復原。它服務於各個行業","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 基礎設施","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":110.91,"h":115.6,"l":110.21,"c":115.37,"v":2709900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":115.41,"h":116.59,"l":115.39,"c":116.47,"v":1982300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":117.0,"h":118.99,"l":115.2,"c":118.83,"v":2049800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":119.0,"h":120.46,"l":117.54,"c":118.75,"v":1412900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":118.83,"h":121.33,"l":118.38,"c":121.17,"v":3018300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":121.6,"h":123.25,"l":120.73,"c":123.12,"v":2000800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":123.67,"h":124.62,"l":122.74,"c":123.53,"v":2170200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":124.3,"h":125.63,"l":122.58,"c":125.09,"v":2106600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":125.05,"h":125.26,"l":123.75,"c":124.0,"v":1868600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":124.3,"h":125.82,"l":123.42,"c":124.16,"v":2477800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":124.06,"h":124.56,"l":122.67,"c":123.37,"v":1685000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":123.2,"h":124.76,"l":122.21,"c":123.92,"v":1770500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":123.88,"h":126.54,"l":123.88,"c":126.36,"v":1842400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":126.54,"h":126.66,"l":124.35,"c":125.16,"v":7250400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":124.52,"h":125.21,"l":123.75,"c":124.61,