9QZ0ZBYzZqRGpKS3ZhNFdzbnc5S2dQTjVHVi13Znc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-09","zh":"從 NetApp Insight 2026 中需要了解的 3 件事"}],"themes":[{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":2},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"半導體/晶片","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-06-05","period":"2026-04-24","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1002047/000119312526259683/ntap-20260424.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"NetApp, Inc. (NetApp, we, us, or the Company), headquartered in San Jose, California, is a global leader in Intelligent Data Infrastructure. Since our founding in 1992, we have transformed from a pioneering storage hardware provider into a software-driven, cloud-centric data infrastructure company. Our flagship ONTAP data management software, together with a comprehensive portfolio of all-flash, hybrid-flash, and cloud-native solutions, forms the backbone of digital transformation for thousands of enterprises worldwide. NetApp empowers organizations to manage, protect, and leverage data across on-premises, hybrid, and multi-cloud environments. We are well positioned to enable Intelligent Data Infrastructure for our customers and help them realize the full promise of artificial intelligence (AI) providing solutions that connect, protect, and activate data across every data environment—on-","zh":"NetApp, Inc.（NetApp、我們、我們或公司）總部位於加州聖荷西，是智慧資料基礎設施的全球領導者。自 1992 年成立以來，我們已從一家領先的儲存硬體供應商轉型為軟體驅動、以雲端為中心的資料基礎設施公司。我們的旗艦 ONTAP 資料管理軟體以及全面的全快閃、混合快閃記憶體和雲端原生解決方案組合構成了全球數千家企業數位轉型的支柱。 NetApp 使組織能夠跨本地、混合和多雲環境管理、保護和利用資料。我們有能力為客戶啟用智慧數據基礎設施，並幫助他們實現人工智慧 (AI) 的全部承諾，提供跨每個數據環境連接、保護和激活數據的解決方案"},{"en":"NetApp operates at the intersection of major industry megatrends—rapid data growth, multi-cloud adoption, and the rise of AI—which are creating unprecedented challenges and opportunities for organizations as they seek to securely manage and leverage growing data estates. Well positioned to address these complexities, NetApp empowers Intelligent Data Infrastructure for our customers through our solutions, which seamlessly connect, manage and protect data across any environment. Our first-party native integration with all major hyperscalers—Amazon Web Services (AWS), Microsoft Azure, and Google Cloud—combined with decades of data management leadership, uniquely enables customers to harness these shifts for competitive advantage.","zh":"NetApp 處於主要行業大趨勢（資料快速成長、多雲採用和人工智慧興起）的交匯點，這些趨勢為尋求安全管理和利用不斷增長的資料資產的組織帶來了前所未有的挑戰和機會。 NetApp 能夠很好地解決這些複雜問題，透過我們的解決方案為客戶提供智慧資料基礎設施，這些解決方案可跨任何環境無縫連接、管理和保護資料。我們與所有主要超大規模供應商（Amazon Web Services (AWS)、Microsoft Azure 和 Google Cloud）的第一方本機集成，再加上數十年的資料管理領先地位，使客戶能夠利用這些轉變來獲得競爭優勢。"},{"en":"Modernizing Data Infrastructure: We help organizations modernize their data infrastructure to deliver greater performance, efficiency, and agility. Our industry-leading hybrid-flash and all-flash storage solutions, powered by ONTAP , provide the foundation for mission-critical workloads, while our hybrid multi-cloud capabilities enable seamless data mobility and management across diverse environments. By simplifying operations and reducing total cost of ownership, we empower customers to accelerate their digital transformation journeys.","zh":"資料基礎設施現代化：我們協助組織實現資料基礎架構現代化，以提供更高的效能、效率和敏捷性。我們業界領先的混合快閃記憶體和全快閃儲存解決方案由 ONTAP 提供支援，為任務關鍵型工作負載奠定了基礎，而我們的混合多雲功能可實現跨不同環境的無縫資料移動和管理。透過簡化營運和降低整體擁有成本，我們幫助客戶加速其數位轉型之旅。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"As of April 24, 2026, our worldwide sales and marketing functions consisted of approximately 5,000 managers, sales representatives and technical support personnel. We have offices in over 20 countries. Sales to two of our major customers accounted for 43% of our net revenues in fiscal 2026. Information about sales to and accounts receivables from our major customers, segment disclosures, foreign operations and net sales attributable to our geographic regions is included in Note 14 – Segment, Geographic, and Significant Customer Information of the Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements included in Part II, Item 8.","zh":"截至 2026 年 4 月 24 日，我們的全球銷售和行銷職能部門由約 5,000 名經理、銷售代表和技術支援人員組成。我們在 20 多個國家設有辦事處。對我們兩個主要客戶的銷售占我們 2026 財年淨收入的 43%。有關對我們主要客戶的銷售和應收帳款、分部揭露、海外業務和歸屬於我們地理區域的淨銷售額的資訊包含在附註 14 – 第二部分第 8 項中的合併財務報表附註的分部、地理和重要客戶資訊中。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in markets characterized by rapid technological change, evolving customer requirements, and frequent introductions of new products, services, and business models. Customer demand continues to be influenced by cloud adoption, digital transformation initiatives, cybersecurity requirements, and increasing use of artificial intelligence and data driven applications.","zh":"我們所處的市場具有快速的技術變革、不斷變化的客戶需求以及頻繁推出的新產品、服務和商業模式。客戶需求繼續受到雲端採用、數位轉型計劃、網路安全要求以及人工智慧和數據驅動應用程式的日益使用的影響。"},{"en":"We compete in the storage, data management, and AI data pipeline markets, including on-premises infrastructure, hybrid cloud environments, and public cloud services. Our offerings compete with a wide range of vendors that provide data storage systems, data management software, and related services. Some competitors offer broad portfolios spanning multiple infrastructure and software categories, while others focus on specific technologies, workloads, or delivery models.","zh":"我們在儲存、資料管理和人工智慧資料管道市場展開競爭，包括本地基礎設施、混合雲環境和公有雲服務。我們的產品與提供資料儲存系統、資料管理軟體和相關服務的眾多供應商競爭。一些競爭對手提供涵蓋多個基礎設施和軟體類別的廣泛產品組合，而其他競爭對手則專注於特定技術、工作負載或交付模型。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-04-24","items":[{"name":"Hybrid Cloud","val":6237000000,"zh":"混合雲部門"},{"name":"All-Flash Revenues","val":4178000000,"zh":"全快閃收入"},{"name":"Hybrid-Flash & Other Revenues","val":2059000000,"zh":"混合快閃記憶體和其他收入"},{"name":"Public Cloud","val":688000000,"zh":"公有雲部門"}],"total":6925000000},"prod":{"end":"2026-04-24","items":[{"name":"Service","val":3731000000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Support","val":2636000000,"zh":"支援"},{"name":"Public Cloud","val":688000000,"zh":"公有雲"},{"name":"Professional & Other Services","val":407000000,"zh":"專業及其他服務"}],"total":6925000000},"geo":{"end":"2026-04-24","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":3505000000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":3293000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":2358000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":1062000000,"zh":"亞太"}],"total":6925000000}},"peers":["VRSN","AKAM","FFIV","CIEN","KLAC"]}}